@host = http://localhost:8080
@apikey = dev-local-webhook-key

### 1. Valid payment -> 202 Accepted
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-001",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 1250.50,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 2. Same id_transacao again -> 200 OK, duplicate: true
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-001",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 1250.50,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 3. Missing ApiKey -> 401
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-002",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 100,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 4. Invalid ApiKey -> 401
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: wrong-key

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-003",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 100,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 5. Invalid payload (negative amount) -> 400, but persisted as Rejected
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-004",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": -5,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 6. Second payment on the same contract -> check the sum in contract_status
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-005",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 300.00,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-16T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 7. Malformed JSON -> 400, not persisted
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{ this is not json }

### 8. Missing id_transacao -> 400, persisted with a synthetic key (MISSING:...)
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 100,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}

### 9. Rate limit: fire this same request 250+ times fast (manually or with a script) to
### exceed the token bucket (default TokenLimit=200) -> 429 with a Retry-After header.
### Retrying the same id_transacao afterwards is still accepted exactly once — 429 never
### persists anything, so it never breaks idempotency.
POST {{host}}/webhooks/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apikey}}

{
  "id_transacao": "TX-RATE-LIMIT-DEMO",
  "id_contrato": "CT-42",
  "valor": 10,
  "data_pagamento": "2026-09-15T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "PAGO"
}
